data: {"id": "38121fba71d1446b-thinking-parallel_evidence-1559", "run_id": "38121fba71d1446b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "所有工具结果已采集完毕，证据链已完整。现在总结事实：\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Kubernetes 生命周期确认 (Metrics + Pod YAML + Describe)\n- Pod `aiops-case-v04/workload` (UID: `c4405668-4a40-44eb-9eed-a40f1a4ace4a`) 当前状态为 **Pending** / **ContainerCreating**，调度到 **node2**。\n- `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"}` = 1, `restarts_total` = 0 → 从未成功启动过。\n\n### 2. 卷定义 (Pod YAML)\n- Pod 定义了 1 个 volume：\n  ```yaml\n  volumes:\n  - name: input\n    secret:\n      secretName: unavailable-input   # 注意：secret 字段值即 secretName\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789120541885, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

